color get_fog(void) ->
Returns the current fog color.

table{number=nil|fvec3} get_intelloc(void) ->
Returns the locations of all intels. The table key is teamid+1 for some reason. If any intel is hidden, its value is <samp>nil</samp>.

table{number=nil|fvec3} get_tentloc(void) ->
Returns the locations of all tents. The table key is teamid+1. If any tent is hidden, its value is <samp>nil</samp>.

boolean input_on_stdin(void) ->
Deprecated.

void set_reload_time(plid pid, clk time) ->
Schedules reload_player() to be called for <var>pid</var> at <var>time</var>.
Unschedules instead if <var>time</var>=<kbd>0</kbd>.

void set_cull_personality(integer personality) ->
Sets the server's cull (block gravity) personality.

<p>Voxlap and OpenSpades cull behavior differ on a spade 3x destroy or a grenade destroy
where not all voxels in the destroyed area are solid, and floating voxels are adjacent
to any one of those nonsolid voxels; Voxlap will remove the floating voxels, OpenSpades
will not.

<p>BetterSpades behaves the same as Voxlap.

<p><var>personality</var> may be either CULL_PERSONALITY_VOXLAP or CULL_PERSONALITY_OPENSPADES.
LSd defaults to CULL_PERSONALITY_OPENSPADES.

function iter_block_line(ivec3 start, ivec3 end) ->
Iterates over all voxels in a block line started at <var>start</var> and ended at <var>end</var>.
Does not check them for solidity; this is just the pure modified DDA algorithm.
